LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_EventScript_ScottAboardSSTidalCall::
	lockall
	pokenavcall LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ScottAboardSSTidalCall
	waitmessage
	clearflag FLAG_SCOTT_CALL_BATTLE_FRONTIER
	releaseall
	end

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchAwayOnFieldwork:
	.string "嗯？你找小田卷博士？\p博士出去进行野外调查了。\n所以他不在这里。\p哦，我来说明一下\n什么叫野外调查吧。\p就是在田野、山林这样的\n自然环境里研究事物，\l而不是待在实验室里。\p博士不喜欢坐在桌前工作。\n他是那种宁愿出门\l亲身体验\l也不愿在这里看书的人。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchIsntOneForDeskWork:
	.string "博士不喜欢坐在桌前工作。\n他是那种宁愿出门\l亲身体验\l也不愿在这里看书的人。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchEnjoysRivalsHelpToo:
	.string "小田卷博士正在研究宝可梦的\n栖息地和分布情况。\p博士也很喜欢让{RIVAL}帮忙。\n他们感情很好。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_LikeYouToHavePokemon:
	.string "小田卷博士：那么，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p我从你爸爸那里\n听说了很多关于你的事。\p我听说你还没有\n属于自己的宝可梦。\p但你刚才的对战，\n打得真是漂亮！\p看来你果然继承了\n你爸爸的血脉！\p对了。为了感谢你救了我，\n我想把刚才那只宝可梦\l送给你。\p{PLAYER}得到了{STR_VAR_1}！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_WhyNotGiveNicknameToMon:
	.string "小田卷博士：机会难得，\n要不要给那只{STR_VAR_1}取昵称？$"
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MightBeGoodIdeaToGoSeeRival:
	.string "小田卷博士：只要好好钻研\n宝可梦、积累经验，\l我相信你会成为很棒的训练家。\p我的孩子{RIVAL}也在\n一边帮忙一边研究宝可梦。\p{PLAYER}{KUN}，你不觉得\n去见见{RIVAL}比较好吗？$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_GetRivalToTeachYou:
	.string "小田卷博士：太好了！\n{RIVAL}也一定会很高兴。\p去让{RIVAL}教教你\n什么才是训练家吧。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_DontBeThatWay:
	.string "小田卷博士：哎呀，别这样嘛。\n你还是去见见我的孩子吧。$"
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRivalGoneHome:
	.string "小田卷博士：{RIVAL}？\n我想是回家了吧。\p说不定那孩子又在哪里的\n草丛里到处乱转了……\p要是你或者宝可梦累了，\n就该回家好好休息。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_HeardYouBeatRivalTakePokedex:
	.string "小田卷博士：哦，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p我听说你第一次对战\n就赢了{RIVAL}。太精彩了！\p{RIVAL}一直以来\n都在帮我做研究。\p{RIVAL}早就积累了\n丰富的训练家经验。\p来，{PLAYER}{KUN}，这是我为研究\n订购的宝可梦图鉴，\l现在就交给你吧。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ReceivedPokedex:
	.string "{PLAYER}得到了宝可梦图鉴！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ExplainPokedex:
	.string "小田卷博士：宝可梦图鉴是高科技\n工具，会自动记录\l你遇到或捕获的每只宝可梦。\p我的孩子{RIVAL}带着它\n到处旅行。\p每当孩子捕获到稀有宝可梦\n并把资料记进图鉴，\l{RIVAL}就会趁我外出\l做野外调查时来找我看。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CountlessPokemonAwait:
	.string "小田卷博士：无数的宝可梦\n在等着你！\p唉，我又忍不住想出去\n进行野外调查了！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayGotPokedexTooTakeThese:
	.string "小遥：哇，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n你也拿到宝可梦图鉴了！\p太好了！跟我一样！\n我也要给你点东西！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CatchCutePokemonWithPokeBalls:
	.string "小遥：能收集到很多宝可梦\n会很开心的！\p我想找各种各样的宝可梦，\n所以会到处去找。\p要是找到可爱的宝可梦，\n我就用精灵球把它抓住！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_OhYourBagsFull:
	.string "哦？你的包包满了。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayWhereShouldIGoNext:
	.string "小遥：接下来该去哪里\n找宝可梦好呢？$"
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanGotPokedexTooTakeThese:
	.string "小悠：嗯……\n你也拿到宝可梦图鉴了啊。\p那好，给你。\n这些就送你吧。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CatchCoolPokemonWithPokeBalls:
	.string "小悠：你知道吗，宝可梦\n还是越多越好玩。\p我要到处去探险，\n去找各种各样的宝可梦。\p要是找到够酷的宝可梦，\n我一定用精灵球把它收服。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_HeyYourBagsFull:
	.string "喂，你的包包满了。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanWhereShouldIGoNext:
	.string "小悠：接下来该去哪里\n找宝可梦好呢……$"
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_SeriousLookingMachine:
	.string "这是一台看起来很严肃的机器。\n博士一定是用来做研究的。$"
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_PCUsedForResearch:
	.string "这是用于研究的电脑。\n最好别乱动它。$"
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CrammedWithBooksOnPokemon:
	.string "里面塞满了关于宝可梦的书。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BookTooHardToRead:
	.string "是一本太难读懂的书。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_OtherRegionsUpgradeToNational:
	.string "小田卷博士：那么……\p{PLAYER}{KUN}，还有{RIVAL}，\n这些日子你们帮我研究了宝可梦。\p多亏你们的帮助，\n新的发现不断涌现。\p看来在丰缘地区，\n也生活着\l来自其他地区的宝可梦。\p这说明丰缘的自然环境\n是多么的丰富多样，\l充满了变化。\p所以我认为，有必要\n把你们的宝可梦图鉴\l升级为全国模式。\p来，让我看看你们的图鉴。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayUpgradeSoCool:
	.string "小遥：嘻嘻！\p连我的宝可梦图鉴\n都要升级了，好棒！\p这都是因为你抓了\n那么多宝可梦，{PLAYER}{KUN}！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanYouCanThankMe:
	.string "小悠：我跑遍了整个丰缘，\n到处调查宝可梦。\p能拿到全国模式的宝可梦图鉴，\n你可得谢谢我。\p没错，你很走运，{PLAYER}！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_OkayAllDone:
	.string "小田卷博士：好了，全都搞定了！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_PokedexUpgradedToNational:
	.string "{PLAYER}的宝可梦图鉴\n升级为全国模式了！$"
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_GrassyPatchWaiting2:
	.string "小田卷博士：不过听好了。\n你已经当上了冠军，\l但你的宝可梦之旅还没结束。\p宝可梦这条路是没有尽头的。\p在某处，一定有一片草地\n在等着你！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayTakeBreakFromFieldwork:
	.string "小遥：我想暂时从野外调查中\n抽身休息一下。\p我打算在这里\n帮博士一段时间。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanTakeBreakFromFieldwork:
	.string "小悠：眼下，\n我想暂停一下野外调查。\p这段时间我会在这里\n帮博士的忙。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CompletedDexChoosePokemon:
	.string "小田卷博士：哦，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n让我看看你的宝可梦图鉴。\p………………\n………………\p嗯，确实没错。\p你真的完成了\n丰缘地区的宝可梦图鉴。\p这可真是了不起。\p我有件礼物要送给你。\p就当是感谢你\n做出如此出色的成绩。\p礼物就是只在其他地区\n才能见到的稀有宝可梦！\p你可以从这三只里\n任选一只！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CanHaveAnyOneOfRarePokemon:
	.string "小田卷博士：这些是稀有宝可梦，\n只在其他地区才能见到！\p你可以从这三只里\n任选一只！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_YoullTakeCyndaquil:
	.string "小田卷博士：火属性的宝可梦\n火球鼠吸引了你！\p你的眼光还是这么准！\p那么，你选火球鼠吗？$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_YoullTakeTotodile:
	.string "小田卷博士：水属性的宝可梦\n小锯鳄是你的选择！\p你很懂得挑好的宝可梦。\p那么，你就选小锯鳄吗？$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_YoullTakeChikorita:
	.string "小田卷博士：草属性的宝可梦\n菊草叶是你的选择！\p你果然很有眼光。\p那么，你就选菊草叶吗？$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_TakeYourTimeAllInvaluable:
	.string "小田卷博士：慢慢决定\n也不迟。\p它们都是无价之宝。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

@ Unused
LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_PickedFinePokemon:
	.string "小田卷博士：我明白了！\n你挑了一只很棒的宝可梦！$"
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ReceivedJohtoStarter:
	.string "{PLAYER}从小田卷博士那里\n得到了{STR_VAR_1}！$"
	.string ""

@ Unused
LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_NicknameJohtoStarter:
	.string "要给你得到的\n{STR_VAR_1}起个昵称吗？$"
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_GrassyPatchWaiting:
	.string "小田卷博士：听好了，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n你完成了丰缘的宝可梦图鉴，\l但你的宝可梦之旅还没有结束。\p宝可梦这条路是没有尽头的。\p在某处，一定有一片草地\n在等着你！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BetterLeaveOthersAlone:
	.string "你得到了约定的宝可梦。\n其他的就别再碰了。$"
	.string ""

@ Unused
LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_DontHaveAnyRoomForPokemon:
	.string "哦，你已经没有地方\n再放下这只宝可梦了。$"
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayWhatNextImStayingHere:
	.string "小遥：{PLAYER}{KUN}，接下来……\n你打算做什么？\p要继续对战，\n磨练自己的实力吗？\p还是想去补全\n全国图鉴？\p我打算留在这里帮博士。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanPreferCollectingSlowly:
	.string "小悠：比起收集宝可梦，\n我更喜欢慢慢地、踏实地\l培育自己选中的那一只。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayHaveYouGoneToBattleFrontier:
	.string "小遥：哦，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n你去过那个叫\l对战开拓区的地方了吗？$"
	.string ""
	.string ""

